- **Overlap with Track B3:** its generator rewiring (gen-core-tables, generate-core-sources, check-core-surface-ledger, generate-structure-registry, gen-unicode-tables, check-command-table) overlaps B3, where generators become comptime. Fold whichever lands first into the other.
